    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p><br><br><strong>Take part in the development:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Share your ideas, <br></li><li>Participate in playtests,<br></li><li>Give your opinion,<br></li><li>And access devlogs</li></ul><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Tons of features to unleash your creativity:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customize the scene's ambiance (skybox, sun, moon, stars, fog, weather effects...)<br></li><li> Use the characters and faces editor<br></li><li> Draw in 3D<br></li><li> Add 2D or 3D text<br></li><li> Add FX (fire, smoke, muzzle flashes, blood splatter...)<br></li><li> Color any object with the paint tool<br></li><li> Share your diorama online<br></li><li> Support both VR and desktops<br></li><li> Cross platform<br></li><li> Multiplayer scene building coming soon<br></li><li> And more!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Tons of features to unleash your creativity:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customize the scene's ambiance (skybox, sun, moon, stars, fog, weather effects...)<br></li><li> Use the characters and faces editor<br></li><li> Draw in 3D<br></li><li> Add 2D or 3D text<br></li><li> Add FX (fire, smoke, muzzle flashes, blood splatter...)<br></li><li> Color any object with the paint tool<br></li><li> Share your diorama online<br></li><li> Support both VR and desktops<br></li><li> Cross platform<br></li><li> Multiplayer scene building coming soon<br></li><li> And more!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Diorama Maker is an easy to use sandbox toy that lets you build dioramas in both VR and desktop. Choose from thousands of objects and create your own world.",
